{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116885","id":3338697852,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7HAHx8","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116885","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116885.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116885.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116885","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116885/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116885/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116885/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ba7d3f0001882dfb25829d6c457d0dbafd45eb74","number":116885,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix different behavior between debug and release exports for invalid `await` on runtime null","user":{"login":"Scrawach","id":40476180,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDc2MTgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40476180?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach","html_url":"https://github.com/Scrawach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105153\r\n\r\n## Result\r\n\r\n**DEBUG** Build:\r\n```\r\nStart loop\r\nERROR: Parameter \"data.tree\" is null.\r\n   at: get_tree (scene/main/node.h:485)\r\nSCRIPT ERROR: Invalid access to property or key 'process_frame' on a base object of type 'null instance'.\r\n          at: _process (res://node.gd:17)\r\n```\r\n\r\n**RELEASE** Build:\r\n```\r\nStart loop\r\nERROR: Parameter \"data.tree\" is null.\r\n   at: Node::get_tree (.\\scene/main/node.h:548)\r\n```\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>GDScript code example</summary>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nvar _run_loop = 5\r\n# Setting this to true triggers the bug in this example.\r\nvar _remove_from_tree = true\r\n\r\nfunc do_stuff():\r\n\tprint(\"Did stuff\")\r\n\r\nfunc _process(delta):\r\n\tif _remove_from_tree and get_parent():\r\n\t\tget_parent().remove_child(self)\r\n\r\n\tprint(\"Start loop\")\r\n\r\n\twhile _run_loop > 0:\r\n\t\tawait get_tree().process_frame\r\n\t\tdo_stuff()\r\n\t\t_run_loop -= 1\r\n\r\n\tprint(\"End loop\")\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nIt's issue not about `await`. GDScript virtual machine behaves differently in `debug` and `release` exports. `Debug` stops code execution after error, but `release` sometimes doesn't check errors (and not stop). Solution is add checks for operations and terminate execution if an error occurs for `release` export too.\r\n\r\nHowever, `release` export don't generate `SCRIPT ERROR`. Although, in my opinion, it would be nice to see `SCRIPT ERROR` in `release` export too. But I decided to maintain previous behavior.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":fa